BT /F2 11 Tf 50.0 636.0 Td (1. Core Linux Kernel & Commands Viva) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 619.0 Td (- Q1: What is the difference between a Hard Link and a Soft \(Symbolic\) Link in Linux?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 603.0 Td (  A: Hard links share the same inode number; soft links are pointer files referencing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 589.0 Td (  the file path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 573.0 Td (- Q2: Explain the significance of file permissions 754 in octal notation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 557.0 Td (  A: Owner has rwx \(7\), Group has r-x \(5\), Others have r-- \(4\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50.0 533.0 Td (2. Virtualization & Networking Viva) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 516.0 Td (- Q3: What is the difference between Bridged and NAT virtual networking in VMware?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 500.0 Td (  A: Bridged assigns VM its own IP on physical LAN; NAT shares host IP through internal) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 486.0 Td (  routing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 470.0 Td (- Q4: How does the 'diff' and 'patch' workflow work in system administration?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 454.0 Td (  A: diff generates difference delta; patch applies the delta cleanly to production) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 55.0 440.0 Td (  configurations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 156.1 416.0 Td (INVERTIS LEARN LABORATORY REPOSITORY • OFFICIAL PRACTICAL CURRICULUM) Tj ET
